// THE CREDIBLE ALTERNATIVE TO THE PINNED CONTRACT STANDARD, cited as its own upstream because it
// is an independently governed, independently versioned document (DESIGN section 3, external
// upstream decomposition) - it may not be a row inside the Common Paper module, and a comparison
// that names it must name a declaration that exists. This module is a subject anchor only: it
// carries what the document says about itself and nothing about why it was or was not pinned.
// The selection argument lives with the pin, at extdeps.common_paper.cloud_service_agreement.
//
// WHAT THE UPSTREAM SAYS ABOUT ITSELF, read 2026-09-12 (the dated receipt lives in
// gunbc.specification_citation_read_provenance). The page titles the document "Bonterms Cloud
// Terms (Version 1.0)"; the Definitions section defines "Bonterms Cloud Terms" as "these Bonterms
// Cloud Terms (Version 1.0)"; the parties complete and execute a Cover Page that incorporates the
// terms by reference and specifies the Key Terms and any Additional Terms; the footer reads
// "(c) 2022 Bonterms. Free to use under CC BY 4.0." The page carries a copyright year and no
// release date, so no release date is transcribed here.
